   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparation of Belize&#xE2;&#x20AC;&#x2122;s First Biennial Transparency Report and a combined Second Biennial Transparency Report and Fifth National Communication (BTR1 and BTR2/NC5) to the United Nations Framework Convention on Climate Change (UNFCCC)</narrative>
